From 7ca3ba08a28191221a498d28d0f285be03868991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 10:31:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Restructure Risk Story tab into six evidence-backed
 sub-tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds Risk Summary, Property Details, Risk Protections, Data Sources,
Map & GIS and Satellite Imagery views under Risk Story, each led by a
full-width AI Summary (band, confidence, key bullets) followed by the
section's content — replacing the old narrative/drivers layout with a
right-rail AI panel. Risk Summary keeps a peril scorecard with
expandable per-peril factor derivation tables, positive/watch-item
lists, endorsements and the 5-year loss trend chart.

Promotes ObservationBanner, SectionCard, Chip, SourceTag/SourceButton,
SourcePreviewModal, WhyResolvePanel, ExpandToggle, MetricRow and
LabelValueGrid to exports of FindingCategoryDetail.tsx so the new
RiskStoryDetail.tsx component can reuse them.
